# Implementation Plan - Gurudevi UI Redesign

## Goal Description
Transform the "functional" UI of Gurudevi Mobile into a "Soulful, Artistic, and Premium" experience, focusing on the Lotus FAB, Mood Tracker, Profile Screen, and Global Headers.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Confirm availability of "Golden Lotus" assets (Bud/Bloom) in `assets/images/`.
> - Validate the "floating bubble" physics feel on actual device if possible.

## Proposed Changes

### Mood Tracker
#### [MODIFY] [MoodLotus.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/self/MoodLotus.tsx)
- Update `Slider` styling using `@gluestack-ui/themed` tokens/props or custom styles if needed.
- Add `hapticSelection()` on slider value change (throttled).
- Ensure glow opacity and lotus state react smoothly to slider value.

### Lotus FAB
#### [MODIFY] [LotusPetalFAB.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/LotusPetalFAB.tsx)
- Replace SVG/Icon with `Image` source for Golden Lotus (Bud/Bloom).
- Enhance `useAnimatedStyle` for breathing to be more organic.
- Update `PanGestureHandler` logic to add "spring" physics (bubble effect) when dragging and releasing.

### Profile Section
#### [NEW] [IdentityCard.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx)
- Floating glassmorphism card.
- Component structure: Avatar + Progress Ring, Name/Role/School, Verification Badge.
- Flip interaction logic using Reanimated `rotateY`.

#### [NEW] [ControlScroll.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/ControlScroll.tsx)
- Vertical list of "LotusPetal" items (Language, Theme, Data Saver).
- `LotusPetalItem` sub-component with glow on touch.

#### [NEW] [EditProfileModal.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/EditProfileModal.tsx)
- Full-screen modal for editing details.

#### [MODIFY] [ProfileScreen.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/ProfileScreen.tsx)
- Remove existing layouts (Tabs).
- Integrate `IdentityCard` and `ControlScroll`.
- Add `EditProfileModal` trigger.

### Global Header
#### [NEW] [GlobalHeader.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/GlobalHeader.tsx)
- Props: `title` (optional), `showGreeting` (boolean), `subtitle` (optional).
- "Ayubowan, [Name]" logic for greeting mode.
- Contextual aesthetics.

## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- N/A (UI heavy)

### Manual Verification
- **Mood Tracker**: Slide the tracker, feel haptics, see lotus bloom.
- **FAB**: Drag the FAB, see it float/spring. Watch it breathe.
- **Profile**: Check Identity Card flip, Edit Modal opening, Control Scroll items.
- **Header**: Check Home screen greeting and other screen headers.
